# Line ends are part of what this repository compares byte for byte: golden files, the recorded gallery, the scripts the CI
# runs. git must never rewrite them for a system, so every text file is LF in the repository and LF in the checkout (on Windows
# as well: core.autocrlf would otherwise write CRLF into the goldens and every golden test would fail at its first line).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Recordings of terminals keep the bytes they were captured with, carriage returns included.
internal/tui/vt/testdata/** -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
